Security baseline
Multi-factor authentication for privileged users where supported.
Encryption in transit and at rest; secrets and API credentials stored securely, never in ordinary records.
Company/tenant isolation and row-level authorization on every financial entity.
Maker-checker controls for sensitive actions and configurable approval limits.
Audit log for create, edit, approve, post, reverse, export, file and payment-related actions.
Session revocation and immediate access disablement when a user is deactivated.
