AI design rules
Use permission-filtered, tenant-specific data; never expose another company's data.
Prefer structured queries and deterministic calculations for balances, GST totals, ageing and forecasts; use the language model to explain results.
Every material answer should show the period, filters, calculation basis and links/references to source records.
If data is incomplete or stale, state the limitation and do not invent a number.
Separate facts, estimates, recommendations and assumptions visually.
Require confirmation before sending messages, changing records, posting entries, filing returns or initiating payments.
Log prompts/actions and the records accessed according to privacy and retention policy.
